# Codex OPUS-CODEX-20261015-10 Q8: call: R runs R's one selected body, Later's, over R's composed data. Later's
# place holds Other's body when the merge runs (Later: Other): the body R holds is not the selected one, so the
# call is refused, never run with either body (l2_m2_copy_source).
Model:
    int: x 1
    x: x + 1
end: Model
Later:
    int: pad 2
    int: x 3
    x: x + 10
end: Later
Other:
    int: pad 5
    int: x 4
    x: x + 100
end: Other
Later: Other
R: merge: Model Later
call: R
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: R\x; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
